,"l":1},{"i":"4:147:10","a":"شَاكِرًا","t":"All-Appreciative","p":"N","tr":"shākiran","f":["ACT","PCPL","M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":143,"l":644},{"i":"4:147:11","a":"عَلِيمًۭا","t":"All-Knowing","p":"ADJ","tr":"ʿalīman","f":["MS","INDEF","ACC"],"r":5,"l":68},{"e":"١٤٧","v":"4:147"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"4:141","t":"Those who wait [and watch] you. Then if you gain a victory from Allāh, they say, \"Were we not with you?\" But if the disbelievers have a success, they say [to them], \"Did we not gain the advantage over you, but we protected you from the believers?\" Allāh will judge between [all of] you on the Day of Resurrection, and never will Allāh give the disbelievers over the believers a way [to overcome them].","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":141,"sd":null},{"k":"4:142","t":"Indeed, the hypocrites [think to] deceive Allāh, but He is deceiving them. And when they stand for prayer, they stand lazily, showing [themselves to] the people and not remembering Allāh except a little,","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":142,"sd":null},{"k":"4:143","t":"Wavering between them, [belonging] neither to these [i.e., the believers] nor to those [i.e., the disbelievers]. And whoever Allāh sends astray - never will you find for him a way.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":143,"sd":null},{"k":"4:144","t":"O you who have believed, do not take the disbelievers as allies instead of the believers. Do you wish to give Allāh against yourselves a clear case?","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":144,"sd":null},{"k":"4:145","t":"Indeed, the hypocrites will be in the lowest depths of the Fire - and never will you find for them a helper -","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":145,"sd":null},{"k":"4:146","t":"Except for those who repent, correct themselves, hold fast to Allāh, and are sincere in their religion for Allāh, for those will be with the believers. And Allāh is going to give the believers a great reward.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":146,"sd":null},{"k":"4:147","t":"What would Allāh do with [i.e., gain from] your punishment if you are grateful and believe? And ever is Allāh Appreciative and Knowing.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":147,"sd":null}],"juz":5,"hizb":10,"surahs":[4],"sajdah":false}